#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0132B expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "The ABSENT-column half of the second conjunct. NO BASE column at all: row 1 CHG populated -> the bare empty(BASE) leaf broadcast-folds TRUE (absent = all-missing, EC-43) -> FIRES. Plan B phase 4d' deleted the not var_exists(BASE) disjunct this note used to name; the verdict is unchanged. Row 2 CHG missing -> first conjunct false -> silent. BASE is an absent Output_Variable, so pin AVAL and CHG only. ⛔ THE M2-D24 CASE: the CHG column satisfies Requirements.Variables.Any [CHG, PCHG, R2BASE] and the rule binds, but put BASE into Requirements and this scenario REDS as skipped -- the rule would stop detecting the defect it exists for, on the very dataset that carries it."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 nameOnly=AVAL nameOnly=CHG
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col CHG     type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 10 | 5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALB | 10 | .
